  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 216.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 216.01 Scope. This part allows an individual, whose vehicle has been removed from its location and stored at another by an authorized official, to request a hearing to contest the removal.\n\nSource. #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c200.html"
